{"event_type":"review","id":"4f09ea39449521ebcfda81cf9a4a7b3e715e7a27107cb082506e2c25add6d439","occurred_at":"2026-11-05T21:15:05Z","payload":{"artifacts":[{"location":"/home/ctaylor/.local/share/crq-backfill/artifacts/sha256/c3550151bbc06d2bc9cc2dbc3c13ff856c74de78683ad34869b26f5c088730c8","sha256":"c3550151bbc06d2bc9cc2dbc3c13ff856c74de78683ad34869b26f5c088730c8"},{"location":"/home/ctaylor/.local/share/crq-backfill/artifacts/sha256/e268a91c46328928e16d28fd9a39dbcf6069eb253988d0475370aaf69d20d6f5","sha256":"e268a91c46328928e16d28fd9a39dbcf6069eb253988d0475370aaf69d20d6f5"},{"kind":"git-bundle","location":"/home/ctaylor/.local/share/crq-backfill/artifacts/sha256/1483790fbac07608d5d2f7cd3d62f9cbaa2b44a9b0d6d7d75a0e69a599f6fed8","sha256":"1483790fbac07608d5d2f7cd3d62f9cbaa2b44a9b0d6d7d75a0e69a599f6fed8"},{"location":"/home/ctaylor/.local/share/crq-backfill/artifacts/sha256/d32bc8814b266bd1d81f45f68958006296cd23dc7623106d225ddb0bfd0dbb8d","sha256":"d32bc8814b266bd1d81f45f68958006296cd23dc7623106d225ddb0bfd0dbb8d"},{"location":"/home/ctaylor/.local/share/crq-backfill/artifacts/sha256/1944cf82890eca6b390d3e8a25aa3f8d575ce1051bbe561cdccb99296f445c20","sha256":"1944cf82890eca6b390d3e8a25aa3f8d575ce1051bbe561cdccb99296f445c20"}],"attempt_id":"aacac91bdece135b49d484f405f7b2b1b2e2db07083eba0ed0c7ffd0f74b9e49:0:1","base":"e38fa2e547f794328be7a3df9995cf5a4c2626d9","completion":{"errors":[],"exit_code":0,"scope_verified":true,"skipped":false,"terminal":true},"findings":[{"anchor_status":"unverified","blob":"ed4cd31a14e30669ccc8f61896fb6ef53a7bc1af","body":"**A first launch on an uncached image can exceed the 15 s `create` limit.**\n\nThe `docker create` call at `src/sandbox/backend.ts:347-351` uses `controlOptions`, which sets `timeoutMs` to `CONTAINER_CONTROL_TIMEOUT_MS` (15 s). The create argv has no `--pull` flag. Docker and Podman `create` pull a missing image by default, so an uncached image is pulled inside this call. Nothing in the repository pre-pulls the image or documents a manual pre-pull step.\n\nIf the pull and extraction take longer than 15 s, `runChild` can terminate the process group (`killGroup`, `src/sandbox/launcher.ts:126-133`) and report `timedOut`. `created` is then not ok, and the launch returns that failure. The next launch can repeat the same pull.\n\nPull the image in its own step with a larger limit, then run `create` with `--pull never`. Check the local cache first. This keeps a host with a cached image from contacting the registry.\n\n<details>\n<summary>Proposed fix</summary>\n\n```diff\n const CONTAINER_CONTROL_TIMEOUT_MS = 15_000;\n+const CONTAINER_PULL_TIMEOUT_MS = 300_000;\n```\n\n```diff\n-          created = await runChild(\n-            launcher,\n-            ['create', '--name', name, ...createArgs],\n-            controlOptions,\n-          );\n+          const inspected = await runChild(\n+            launcher,\n+            ['image', 'inspect', resolved.image],\n+            controlOptions,\n+          );\n+          const pulled = inspected.ok\n+            ? inspected\n+            : await runChild(launcher, ['pull', resolved.image], {\n+                ...controlOptions,\n+                timeoutMs: CONTAINER_PULL_TIMEOUT_MS,\n+              });\n+          created = pulled.ok\n+            ? await runChild(\n+                launcher,\n+                ['create', '--pull', 'never', '--name', name, ...createArgs],\n+                controlOptions,\n+              )\n+            : pulled;\n```\n\n</details>","id":"b289af5c7aa23ed7f97213cac4fef4e3631f679d2b1219f15931929bd61920d3","intervals":[],"path":"src/sandbox/backend.ts","severity":"minor","source_id":null,"status":"untriaged","title":"A first launch on an uncached image can exceed the 15 s `create` limit."}],"head":"56044472e4d6cb6530c2dfa9c2f153e7ffb544aa","head_tree":"013c2fa4bf520f2358e9d1367a3d73c21ab4fb44","input_scope":[{"blob":"034a523217a667408308468117ad628a9a15a767","intervals":[[1,109]],"path":"docs/sandbox-container-image.md"},